{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just started your career at the renowned but enigmatic Omnituens Corp, only to discover you've been assigned to a clandestine role with responsibilities shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the company's operations, you'll begin to uncover and control its most valuable secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651540/extras/b374329724ba2063e3cf118f40c513df.avif?t=1758793491\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Clues:</strong> Engage in conversations and meticulously search through text to find hidden &quot;keywords&quot; that unlock new information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze and Unravel:</strong> Piece together the keywords you've collected to expose the deeper secrets lurking within the company and its employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Corporate Ladder:</strong> Complete missions to boost your job performance, earning promotions that grant you greater authority and access.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Intimate Relationships:</strong> Use the information and influence you've gained to your advantage. Pursue the beautiful women in your office, uncovering their personal secrets and developing unique, intimate relationships with them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters[/h2]</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651540/extras/dfc938e958bca4b8d2e51641a1292b4e.poster.avif?t=1758793491\" width=850 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea